10. Major System Modules
Module 1 – User Management
Handles registration, login, profiles, and authentication.
Module 2 – Story Generator
Uses Gemini to transform user ideas into structured stories.
Module 3 – Character Generator
Creates and manages character profiles.
Module 4 – Scene & Panel Generator
Breaks the story into comic scenes and panels.
Module 5 – Dialogue Generator
Creates character dialogue, narration, and sound effects.
Module 6 – Visual Generation
Creates visual prompts and integrates artwork generation.
Module 7 – Comic Editor
Allows users to customize generated content.
Module 8 – Project Management
Stores, retrieves, updates, and deletes comic projects.
Module 9 – Export
Converts the completed comic into a shareable format.
