13. Constraints
•	AI-generated content may occasionally be inaccurate or inconsistent.
•	Image-generation capabilities depend on the selected image-generation service.
•	Gemini/API usage may be subject to quotas, pricing, latency, and service availability.
•	Maintaining identical character appearance across independently generated images can be challenging.
•	Internet connectivity is required for cloud-based AI generation.
